   {
    "draw": [
     "row0"
    ],
    "speak": "The champion is the elephant: about twenty-two months, almost two years."
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "row1"
    ],
    "speak": "A giraffe takes about fifteen months, and its calf arrives with a drop of about one and a half metres to the ground."
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "row2"
    ],
    "speak": "We come third, with nine months."
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "row3"
    ],
    "speak": "Then a big drop: a dog needs only about two months."
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "row4"
    ],
    "speak": "And a golden hamster just sixteen days, one of the shortest of any mammal."
   },
